       pub-id    : DOI of the parent article
       uri       : locations of the parent article (TreatmentBank,
                   Zenodo/BLR, BiodiversityPMC), typed with @content-type
     Data from TreatmentBank (treatment FC3D2479FFE5FF94F6D3FF4FFA3AFD07). -->
